🍫 Chocolate Sales Analytics Pipeline

An end-to-end analytics project that transforms raw sales data into marketing decision intelligence using PostgreSQL, Python modelling, and Power BI.

This project demonstrates data modelling, feature engineering, opportunity scoring, and dashboard visualisation in a reproducible local environment.

📌 Project Overview

The goal of this project was to identify high-potential product–country combinations for targeted marketing campaigns.

The pipeline:

              Raw Sales Data
                    ↓
              SQL Cleaning & Structuring
                    ↓
              Analytics Mart Layer
                    ↓
              Python Feature Engineering & Scoring
                    ↓
              Opportunity Ranking
                    ↓
              Power BI Executive Dashboard


The result is a monthly ranked Marketing Opportunity Index that highlights combinations with:

              Strong sales volume
              
              Positive growth momentum
              
              Sustained multi-month trends
              
              Controlled volatility

🛠 Tech Stack:

              PostgreSQL 16 (Dockerised)
              
              Python (pandas, numpy, SQLAlchemy)
              
              Power BI
              
              Git
              
              VS Code

