              Opportunity scoring visualisation
              
              Marketing Opportunity Matrix
              
              Scatter plot (Growth vs Volume)
              
              Bubble size = Opportunity Score
              
              Monthly Top 10 ranked opportunities

🚀 Running the Project
              1️⃣ Start PostgreSQL via Docker
              docker run ...
              
              2️⃣ Load raw data
              python python/load/load_chocolate_sales.py
              
              3️⃣ Generate opportunity scores
              python python/analytics/opportunity_scoring.py
              
              4️⃣ Refresh Power BI dashboard
              📈 Business Insight

              This pipeline enables:
              
              Prioritisation of marketing spend
              
              Identification of high-growth product-country combinations
              
              Detection of structural demand changes vs seasonal spikes
              
              Stable growth evaluation using log transformation

